    "result": "All done! I've successfully implemented the feature for frai-gate. Here's a summary of the changes:\n\n## Changes made:\n\n### 1. **Added `renderSummary` function** to `src/gate/report.ts`\n- Exports a new function that generates a one-line summary of the gate result\n- Format: `<VERDICT> <answered>/<total>` (e.g., \"PASS 7/7\", \"BLOCK 5/7: evaluation, transparency\")\n- Handles the special case of missing gate section: returns \"BLOCK 0/7: structure\"\n- Only counts block-severity findings; warnings don't reduce the answered count\n- Lists blocked checks in GATE_CHECKS order, deduplicated\n\n### 2. **Updated CLI** in `src/cli.ts`\n- Added `--summary` flag to `frai-gate check` command\n- Prints only the summary line instead of the full report\n- Maintains exit codes (1 on BLOCK, 0 otherwise)\n- `--json` has priority if both flags are given\n- Updated HELP text with documentation and example\n\n### 3. **Exported `renderSummary`** from `src/index.ts` for library users\n\n### 4. **Added comprehensive tests** in new `src/gate/report.test.ts`\n- 8 test cases covering various scenarios\n- Tests for PASS, WARN, BLOCK verdicts\n- Tests for single and multiple blocked checks\n- Tests for deduplication and special cases\n\n**Build & test results:** \u2705 All 19 tests pass, build succeeds with no errors.",
